WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Ron · team Analog Intelligence · NASA Space Apps 2026

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.000
NASA rehearses Moon missions with rovers and spacesuits on Earth.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Analog Coverage Gap Map: which Moon terrain has an Earth look-alike, and which doesn't?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Pick a square near the lunar south pole (NASA LOLA elevation data).

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
We compare slope and bumpiness with listed Earth sites (ESA Copernicus data).

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.500
60 of 145 Moon squares have no listed-site match. Sampling finds candidates, including Morocco.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Early result: 2 tests failed; 1 could not decide. Rules set before testing.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.900
Next: more sites and ground data to help teams plan what to check before fieldwork.
